854a70a7fdccd90bb24abb6f386981","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: let commands persist their changes","messageBody":"Pass Storage into the Command execution contract and move persistence into mutating command classes. ChatBot now delegates command execution and exit handling without maintaining a separate changed flag, bringing the main loop closer to the stretch-goal design.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":22,"deletions":18}}},{"hash":"ce743c253a9640008e4fed250021d7ae73ce0ad4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: align ui command loop names","messageBody":"Rename Ui.readLine to readCommand and Ui.showDivider to showLine, updating the chatbot loop and welcome display callers. The terminology now matches the stretch-goal API without changing behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"cefbf73d4be814b48d74eade91024ecdf6dbdd78","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: guarantee command loop line cleanup","messageBody":"Read commands before displaying the command divider and move the trailing divider into a finally block. This aligns ChatBot.run with the stretch-goal loop and keeps UI cleanup consistent across successful and failing commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":5,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"dab5d4b54169e79f963a0c1e808f31fbdb802c3e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-MoreOOP\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"68dd5c5b623a3daa4ab94795c69e18a6453052d8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: organize classes into Java packages","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":126,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"a62bb0fa39a88017c912de9d96fd4ee98436186c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-Packages\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Packages"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"594e57a588534c56b32da4