and date-time fields are present.\n\nThese assumptions are required for valid task objects and help detect\nprogrammer errors at construction time.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":6,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"aeae6fa74176c01deca9a01d5a3edfc96c128292","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: add assertions for parsing and storage invariants","messageBody":"Document assumptions about positive task indexes, available date-times,\nand matching task subtypes during serialization.\n\nKeep user and storage validation as explicit exception handling.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":5,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"d217117dda67af821f6537d371218f8f1f7c0610","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"build: enable assertions during Gradle tests","messageBody":"Run tests with JVM assertions enabled so assertion checks are exercised\nduring automated verification.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"c9af86539634d5dc047bafcd596c45992aebdad4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: change shared task response formatting","messageBody":"ListCommand and FindCommand duplicate the same task numbering and\nresponse-building logic, which makes equivalent behavior harder to\nmaintain consistently. Centralize that formatting in Command so both\ncommands share one readable implementation and future response changes\nhave one update point.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":24,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"72af1abb5d55338aacfac5a8ce567fa03e5735bf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor task index validation","messageBody":"TaskList repeats the same bounds check and user-facing error in get and remove. Centralize the validation so both operations follow one consistent rule and future message changes have one maintenance point.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"680aee04b8af8fa459cef394a5776dea72d16af2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Encapsulate immutable task data","messageBody":"Task and Deadline expose state as protected fields even though neither field is reassigned or accessed by subclasses. Make the fields private and final to communicate their invariants and prevent accidental mutation through inheritance.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"a33956de75f0b1cda13a35e283b65b6cb7e36301","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Name GUI layout and timing constants","messageBody":"Main and MainWindow use unexplained numeric literals for window dimensions, typing intervals, and animation cycles. Replace those literals with named constants so the intended layout and timing values are clear and easier to change safely.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"7bce35831430a5b6223b57ccc806b848a16b2b9d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Separate parser dispatch from validation","messageBody":"Parser.parse mixes input normalization, command lookup, and command construction in one method. Extract the dispatch step so the public parsing flow reads as validation followed by command creation while preserving all existing command behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"2463ff34fc2a4558fee1e17e81b6da67641fe9bd","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Separate storage record reconstruction","messageBody":"Storage.deserializeTask combines common record validation, type-specific parsing, and status restoration in one long method. Split those responsibilities into focused helpers so malformed input handling and task construction remain easier to read and maintain.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":37,"deletions":13}}},{"hash":"9b74ef323e2748a6d02cbce2fba99f055e2232d7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Reuse parsed task time values","messageBody":"DateTimeParser repeatedly requests the same optional time while formatting a task date. Store the optional once so each formatting method presents one clear data flow and avoids repeated access.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":8,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"173e4e5e04bae1871d1348634843b486f54ebd7c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Centralize GUI status messages","messageBody":"MainWindow repeats status text across accessibility labels, tooltips, and typing feedback. Store each status message as a named constant so related UI surfaces stay consistent and the intent of each state is explicit.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":10,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"7850859230ebf7b159567f99704354493499fdcf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove redundant empty constructors","messageBody":"Bob, Parser, ByeCommand, and ListCommand declare constructors with no initialization or behavior. Remove the boilerplate and rely on the language-provided public no-argument constructors so the classes stay simpler without changing their API.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":0,"deletions":24}}},{"hash":"fc1ddc4e098683e04cbf37b81fca2cb5e0a9912a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Share task mutation helpers","messageBody":"MarkCommand and UnmarkCommand duplicate one-based task lookup and task-list persistence. Centralize those mechanics in Command while keeping each command\u0027s status change and user-facing response in its own class.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":27,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"219ce89719a0e988272ac969518ef54114cc2634","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Make unknown commands explicit","messageBody":"CommandType.fromKeyword returns null for an unknown keyword, forcing callers to reason about a nullable result. Return Optional instead so absence is explicit and Parser can handle the unknown-command path without a null check.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":13,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"bfd2b4cde4afb93fc1d402c664319916a6d619d8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Handle storage paths without parents","messageBody":"Storage.save assumes every file path has a parent directory, which fails for a simple filename. Create a parent directory only when one exists and add a regression test for parentless paths.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":20,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"5f9dec8a2d5ef44bab0ac234b70edd4f62d80da3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Close loaded image resources","messageBody":"MainWindow.loadImage leaves each resource stream open after constructing an image. Use try-with-resources so image loading releases the stream deterministically and reports close failures clearly.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"c725fdbb0db8b56c96d1c4656dc445c4387a2e4b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Preserve chatbot load failure causes","messageBody":"ChatBot wraps storage load failures in BobException but drops the original IOException, which obscures diagnosis. Add cause-aware exception construction while keeping the user-facing message unchanged.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"1d274e7a5a635206332505845783342787d5af98","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Read GUI input once","messageBody":"MainWindow reads the same text field twice during command submission. Capture the value once so validation and trimming operate on one consistent input snapshot and the control flow is easier to follow.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":3,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"531b11098c3d585464da4849af1564e16b7add2e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Avoid redundant command normalization","messageBody":"Parser lowercases command keywords before calling a case-insensitive lookup, performing the same normalization twice conceptually. Pass the original token and keep case handling in CommandType.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":1,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"48ed2ee013a106d7669c2cba9d14e2f34546cc76","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use shared mutation persistence","messageBody":"AddCommand and DeleteCommand bypass the shared task-persistence helper used by the other mutation commands. Route all task saves through one helper so persistence behavior remains consistent and centralized.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"eeecf522fd314e80da8760f56917f2f19b57be65","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: migrate to use streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":3,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"881cfe1eb451cf2e50a56d4a8b07642c662af4cc","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from raynor-koh/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Improve code quality across the codebase","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d4d61515d5fc6d4e4a047403be03b9ddee8e2fc3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"25f3620b8821bf9239b350f032963625c0bccc9d","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from raynor-koh/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Use streams to serialize tasks","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"bcd3cfe92f08f522cda3ea2359577fc0fb85e0c5","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f43f49f572069626f7309613f3aee387060eb02b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from raynor-koh/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Add assertions for important invariants","tags":["A-CI","A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b3ad3af49fd43c54e4006523ca39b4c84c3cfa52","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"fix: resolve checkstyle indentation errors","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"jav